    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay so it's like a feedback loop between the lungs and the brain. are there any other ways to stimulate the vagus nerve besides breathing? i'm looking for other things i can do during a busy workday to keep my stress levels from spiking too much.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
